{"lines":[{"t":"@MirsIELTS","x":0.0077433933393347828,"y":0.0030922077915033208,"h":0.036538124647112369,"w":0.30491915384928386,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"y":0.043604651190458976,"x":0.84599589560448707,"t":"Test 2","w":0.059548250834147165},{"x":0.073879283496510809,"w":0.047313302357991541,"h":0.010374786016863702,"c":1,"y":0.094376560351127403,"t":"BELLA:"},{"y":0.11046511617229959,"x":0.071868582704620751,"w":0.039014374415079753,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"t":"DON:"},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.069815195499307869,"y":0.15552325595138283,"w":0.051334702173868818,"t":"BELLA:","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.073921970735398218,"y":0.17296511626792954,"t":"DON:","w":0.036960986455281578},{"w":0.049281314214070643,"c":1,"x":0.071868583426845586,"t":"BELLA:","h":0.011627906191665538,"y":0.2020348839971905},{"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"DON:","x":0.073921970741437595,"y":0.23401162789441154,"h":0.0087209302063888661},{"t":"BELLA:","h":0.012013008320226004,"y":0.26434233293066678,"w":0.04945998191833495,"c":1,"x":0.071779249572879011},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.073921970741437595,"y":0.28052325580138837,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"t":"DON:"},{"w":0.049520025253295893,"t":"BELLA:","x":0.071749227823017972,"h":0.010769770349373209,"c":1,"y":0.35726046357526142},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"t":"DON:","x":0.073921970735398218,"y":0.38953488370979006,"w":0.036960986455281578,"c":1},{"y":0.43443290133116375,"c":1,"t":"BELLA:","x":0.071794106229583321,"w":0.049430268605550123,"h":0.011948150589754403},{"x":0.073921972769756164,"h":0.010174418761666915,"w":0.036960983276367196,"c":1,"y":0.46511627882168594,"t":"DON:"},{"h":0.011812161695992307,"c":1,"x":0.071825505957101063,"t":"BELLA:","y":0.48101252368581338,"w":0.04936746915181478},{"t":"DON:","y":0.49709302305151382,"w":0.039014374415079753,"c":1,"x":0.071868582710324605,"h":0.011627907316944963},{"h":0.010496777559803716,"y":0.5434434716637403,"x":0.071803133962003024,"w":0.049412212371826164,"c":1,"t":"BELLA:"},{"y":0.574127906774344,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"x":0.071868582716028459,"w":0.039014374415079739,"t":"DON:"},{"h":0.014749262536873142,"x":0.16837782061579218,"w":0.51129364013671874,"t":"OK... and the leather ankle boots. What was wrong with them?","y":0.091445427643498944,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Apparently, the heels were worn - but that wasn't the problem. One of the shoes","y":0.10562407048279387,"x":0.16621649342553779,"w":0.63882369995117194,"h":0.01878549750223979},{"w":0.62247039794921877,"x":0.16616747794037282,"t":"was a much lighter shade than the other one - it had obviously been left in the","h":0.019530622094078409,"c":1,"y":0.12025058527537102},{"h":0.015330198169809517,"y":0.13760417777312739,"x":0.16625185774716394,"c":1,"w":0.50528772989908854,"t":"sun. I suppose even second-hand shoes should look the same!"},{"y":0.1539823007345229,"x":0.17043120659029304,"c":1,"t":"Sure. Then there were the red baby shoes.","w":0.34086242675781248,"h":0.013274336283185861},{"h":0.017756755795098944,"x":0.16829695459688337,"c":1,"t":"Oh yes - we're told to tie shoes together when we put them in a recycling bin, but","y":0.16780994052856246,"w":0.64699035644531255},{"w":0.20739219665527342,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872223012,"x":0.16632443546216574,"y":0.18604651135700179,"t":"people often don't bother."},{"w":0.61613530476888023,"c":1,"t":"You'd think it would have been easy to find the other, but it wasn't. That was a","y":0.19888379214563079,"x":0.16627633052566126,"h":0.016226720669276551},{"c":1,"w":0.33264887491861983,"h":0.014585476990646273,"y":0.21651917395612275,"x":0.1663244330792806,"t":"shame because they were obviously new."},{"t":"The trainers were interesting. He said they looked like they'd been worn by a","x":0.16837784166639588,"h":0.016071551387640604,"w":0.6057494608561198,"c":1,"y":0.22965116274857578},{"w":0.14004414876302085,"h":0.01238940810031941,"t":"marathon runner.","c":1,"y":0.24788029650589116,"x":0.1682112240305787},{"x":0.16837782347567098,"t":"Yeah - weren't they split?","w":0.20533880869547527,"h":0.014534883302221524,"y":0.26308139555092414,"c":1},{"x":0.16837781184091624,"w":0.63860371907552083,"h":0.014570041532713351,"t":"Not exactly. One of the soles was so worn under the foot that you could put your.","y":0.27758112104531152,"c":1},{"y":0.29351032422211554,"t":"finger through it.","w":0.1334702173868815,"c":1,"h":0.01327433628318575,"x":0.16632443826754487},{"t":"Well, we could certainly use some of those examples in our presentation to","y":0.30649181829384808,"w":0.59360814412434892,"x":0.16829449983778755,"h":0.018009041755248756,"c":1},{"h":0.017712184039540668,"w":0.63874506632486983,"x":0.16831566536574494,"y":0.3226462726035344,"t":"explain why 90 percent of shoes that people take to recycling centres or bins get","c":1},{"x":0.16632443384223086,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"t":"thrown into landfill.","y":0.34011627925948007,"w":0.15400410970052084},{"c":1,"t":"Mmm. What did you think about the project his team set up to avoid this by","y":0.35457227132211666,"x":0.1663244423113692,"h":0.014749262536873031,"w":0.59548253377278648},{"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"making new shoes out of the good parts of old shoes?","c":1,"w":0.42915812174479173,"x":0.17043120604914311,"y":0.37050147464573868},{"t":"It sounded like a good idea. They get so many shoes, they should be able to","x":0.17036291316427801,"h":0.015354127236875459,"c":1,"y":0.38485383887309754,"w":0.60179056803385422},{"c":1,"x":0.16826159188072001,"w":0.61418945312500006,"h":0.019695247098759472,"t":"match parts. I wasn't surprised that it failed, though. I mean who wants to buy","y":0.39887750292093171},{"x":0.16837782103085611,"t":"second-hand shoes really? Think of all the germs you could catch!","y":0.41710914450004166,"w":0.52772074381510414,"h":0.014576901798754704,"c":1},{"x":0.16830072704763069,"h":0.018001150170610325,"w":0.6079340616861979,"c":1,"t":"Well, people didn't refuse them for that reason, did they? It was because the","y":0.43112666030530189},{"x":0.1682198958720999,"w":0.25283086140950517,"h":0.014597205778138722,"c":1,"y":0.44769980084168104,"t":"pairs of shoes weren't identical."},{"w":0.40451746622721357,"c":1,"t":"They still managed to ship them overseas, though.","h":0.015988371857499795,"y":0.46366279081127248,"x":0.16837781709012783},{"h":0.012935860107782027,"t":"That's another area we need to discuss.","c":1,"x":0.17034913693083004,"y":0.47840128204751942,"w":0.3225572713216146},{"w":0.63244354248046875,"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873253,"t":"You know I used to consider this topic just from my own perspective, by thinking","x":0.16837781797600959,"y":0.49410029479961048},{"h":0.018512615552694012,"c":1,"t":"about my own recycling behaviour without looking at the bigger picture. So much","y":0.50819400248912239,"w":0.63880894978841152,"x":0.16828725575443496},{"x":0.17043121033554873,"y":0.52616279052056925,"c":1,"w":0.36550308227539063,"t":"happens once shoes leave the recycling area.","h":0.011627907316944963},{"c":1,"t":"It's not as simple as you first think, and we can show that by taking a very","x":0.16837781645298322,"y":0.54069767462314611,"w":0.58316223144531254,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"c":1,"t":"different approach to it.","y":0.55663716804192542,"w":0.18480492909749352,"x":0.16837782282925412,"h":0.013274336283185861},{"w":0.24229980468750004,"x":0.17043120633807499,"y":0.57256637181737047,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1,"t":"Absolutely. So let's discuss ..."},{"c":1,"t":"Q26","x":0.83572895232659772,"y":0.10610465142285819,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q27","c":1,"y":0.19912790724135376,"x":0.83572895232588473,"w":0.039014374415079711},{"t":"Q28","x":0.83572895232659772,"y":0.2776162793298349,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"y":0.43459302351588147,"t":"Q29","x":0.83572895226773902},{"x":0.83778234034525445,"c":1,"t":"Q30","y":0.54069767468321428,"h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.036960986455281564},{"h":0.016439551519433326,"x":0.073852801263421572,"c":1,"t":"PART 4","y":0.62186743352190477,"w":0.10280774434407551},{"y":0.6497093025328653,"t":"For my project on invertebrates, I chose to study tardigrades. These are microscopic - or to","x":0.073921968695247905,"w":0.72279261271158857,"c":1,"h":0.014597482034238718},{"x":0.07179482524764666,"w":0.73114461263020836,"c":1,"y":0.66339966794588379,"h":0.016250138296841854,"t":"be more precise - near-microscopic animals. There are well over a thousand known species"},{"w":0.69404515584309889,"h":0.014534883302221524,"c":1,"x":0.073921980497029555,"t":"of these tiny animals, which belong to the phylum Tardigrada. Most tardigrades range in","y":0.68023255834668028},{"y":0.69469026524844546,"c":1,"t":"length from 0.05 to 1 millimetre, though the largest species can grow to be 1.2 millimetres in","x":0.071868574462660692,"w":0.72895278930664065,"h":0.016065548584524469},{"t":"length. They are also sometimes called 'water bears': 'water' because that's where they thrive","y":0.70718776240006398,"w":0.74139516194661459,"h":0.01835019215721656,"x":0.071802964537063474,"c":1},{"t":"best, and 'bear' because of the way they move. 'Moss piglet' is another name for tardigrades","x":0.073921969315985048,"y":0.72383720922023276,"w":0.73100616455078127,"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1},{"x":0.073823020495196137,"t":"because of the way they look when viewed from the front. They were first discovered in","w":0.69013290405273442,"h":0.018064479771616848,"y":0.73859794922146105,"c":1},{"x":0.073921969894266457,"w":0.56057495117187495,"h":0.01459662457131361,"y":0.75575221242587109,"t":"Germany in 1773 by Johann Goeze, who coined the name Tardigrada.","c":1},{"x":0.071818212121536745,"w":0.71261550903320314,"h":0.017283348488596695,"c":1,"y":0.77503081906492621,"t":"As I say, there are many different species of tardigrade - too many to describe here - but,"},{"y":0.79059746927450192,"x":0.071812626597905008,"w":0.69415852864583338,"c":1,"t":"generally speaking, the different species share similar physical traits. They have a body","h":0.016474465564288998},{"t":"which is short, and also rounded - a bit like a barrel - and the body comprises four segments.","w":0.7413563028971355,"x":0.073867683119054936,"y":0.80464713084556072,"h":0.016598353203067462,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.82061780394511963,"w":0.73725616455078125,"t":"Each segment has a pair of legs, at the end of which are between four and eight sharp claws.","x":0.075926697798900017,"h":0.015867546666688215},{"y":0.83571570781909876,"w":0.70039072672526037,"t":"I should also say that some species don't have any claws; what they have are discs, and","x":0.073840928523375163,"h":0.017602284749348884,"c":1},{"t":"these work by means of suction. They enable the tardigrade to cling on to surfaces or to","w":0.69199178059895827,"x":0.075975362226490165,"h":0.013274336283185861,"y":0.85162241873191868,"c":1},{"t":"grip its prey. Within the body, there are no lungs, or any organs for breathing at all. Instead,","x":0.073921962508378361,"w":0.72073923746744795,"h":0.016021815162141073,"c":1,"y":0.86627906987751702},{"c":1,"t":"oxygen and also blood are transported in a fluid that fills the cavity of the body.","y":0.88113335065030751,"w":0.62030171712239579,"x":0.073826553056102098,"h":0.016752705531837608},{"t":"Q31","x":0.83778234035129384,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.72529069793689072},{"t":"Q32","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281564,"y":0.79215116305076516,"x":0.8398357284356035},{"c":1,"t":"Q33","x":0.83983572844164278,"y":0.84011627933223954,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q34","w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"y":0.88372093049503031,"x":0.83983572844164278},{"t":"107","c":1,"x":0.87063654979687899,"y":0.92005813970148842,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.014534883302221524},{"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","c":1,"x":0.51176469619230891,"w":0.45882354736328124,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"h":3390,"w":2400}